@host = https://localhost:7022

### 1. Login corect (trebuie 200 + token)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Parola123!"
}

### 2. Cine sunt eu (foloseste automat tokenul de la cererea 1)
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 3. Parola gresita (trebuie 401)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "gresit"
}

### 4. Fara token (trebuie 401)
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me